tests/fixtures/xccdf-results/openscap-RHEL_9-V2R10-arf-truncated.xml was generated for this
project with OpenSCAP 1.3.14, scanning a Red Hat UBI 9 container against DISA's RHEL 9 V2R10
SCAP 1.3 benchmark. It was truncated to 10 rules, OVAL content was removed, and host details were
replaced with documentation addresses.
tests/fixtures/xccdf-results/RHEL_9-V2R10-manual-truncated.cklb holds the same 10 rules from
DISA's RHEL 9 V2R10 manual STIG, converted with stigforage. Both contain DISA STIG content,
truncated for testing.

